I reused the strongest prior items that bear directly on Chapter 4B and added new 2022-anchored source claims from official law, State Dept, HRW, Reuters, and VOA. I did not re-fetch the structured V-Dem/Freedom House/RSF priors already supplied locally.

**Reused evidence**
